            "text": "<ul><li><strong>Brand Agnostic Expertise</strong> - We install bodykits from every bodykit manufacturer - whether it is Maxton Design, CT Carbon, Xclusive Customz, or any other, we install components with uncompromising precision.</li></ul><p></p><ul><li><strong>Any Vehicle, One Standard</strong> - From hatchbacks to full sportscar aero transformations, we apply the same \"dry-fit\" methodology to ensure proper alignment before fixing.</li></ul><p></p><ul><li><strong>Preserving Original Integrity</strong> - We specialise in non-destructive installations. We utilise factory mounting points and automotive-grade adhesives to ensure your car’s original body panels remain intact.</li></ul><p></p><ul><li><strong>The \"No-Cut\" Policy -</strong> To preserve your vehicle’s structural integrity and resale value, we do not undertake installations that require cutting or permanent destruction of factory metalwork.</li></ul><p></p><ul><li><strong>Reversible Precision</strong> - Our fitment process prioritises reversibility. If you ever decide to return your car to its factory state, our installation methods ensure the original bodywork is preserved beneath the kit.</li></ul>"
          }
        },
